message: "If you cite this research programme, please cite it as below."
title: "Designed Functional Maturity (DFM)"
abstract: "A Christian methodological-designist research programme for phased supernatural creation, functional initialization, and historical inference. DFM asks whether a mature physical state necessarily implies that every natural process capable of producing it was historically traversed, and exposes its answer to severe empirical testing."
